sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser · Chat.tsx
  participant R as messages route
  participant S as reply.ts
  participant D as queries.ts · Postgres
  participant P as Claude · claude.ts

  B->>R: POST clientId, content, fileIds
  R->>S: replyResponse
  S->>S: workspaceAdmin · 404 unless users.role is admin
  S->>S: reserveReply · 409 while a reply is running
  S->>S: provider available · 503 without a key
  S->>D: countRepliesSince last hour and day · 429 over the limit
  S->>D: startReply · one transaction
  Note right of D: lock the conversation · archived 409<br/>a known clientId returns the saved rows<br/>stale streams recovered · one streaming reply<br/>files owned, live and eligible<br/>user message · ai_message_files · title<br/>assistant row, streaming
  alt clientId already used
    S-->>B: JSON existing · the model is not asked
  end
  S-->>B: NDJSON start · user message and streaming reply
  S->>D: messages · project instructions
  S->>S: assembleContext · five layers · 150,000-token target
  S->>D: claim or reuse provider copies
  S->>P: messages.stream with the abort signal
  loop text deltas
    P-->>S: delta
    S-->>B: NDJSON delta
    S->>D: saveReplyProgress · at most every second
  end
  alt finished
    S->>D: finishReply complete · stop reason · usage
  else Stop, closed tab or reload
    S->>D: finishReply stopped · the text so far
  else provider failure
    S->>D: finishReply failed · error code · the text so far
  end
  S-->>B: NDJSON done · the saved reply
  S->>S: releaseReply
